# Extension versioning

- Increment the SemVer patch version when a change affects the visible browser-extension UI.
- Do not increment it for CI/workflow, test-only, documentation-only, refactoring, or backend changes without a UI change.
- Verification builds without a UI change keep the current version.
- Keep `browser-extension/manifest.json` and `browser-extension/manifest.chrome.json` on the same version.
- For a UI version bump, update version assertions, the project version in `docs/threat-model.md`, and `RELEASE_NOTES.md` in the same change.
- Run the relevant tests and `tools/build_extension.py`, then report the resulting version and artifact paths.
